  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0: the token can be sent in Authorization: Bearer (WithChromaToken(token, ChromaTokenTransportHeader.Authorization)), and basic authentication is supported (WithBasicAuth); the With* methods keep all the other options. 2.1.0: ChromaClient creates and gets tenants and databases (CreateTenant, GetTenant, CreateDatabase, GetDatabase); the CI also runs all the tests in a non-default tenant and database. 2.0.1: the configuration URI works without the trailing slash, and with just the address of the server, like http://localhost:8000; the packages credit their authors; the CI also tests Chroma 0.5.16. 2.0.0: uses the Chroma v2 API, so the configuration URI ends with /api/v2/. Other breaking changes: ChromaCollectionQueryEntry.Distance is float?, null when the query does not include distances; every async method takes an optional CancellationToken as its last parameter. Fixed: Modify, AddChromaClient, the request URLs of the netstandard2.0 build, the error messages, and the HttpClient passed to the clients is no longer modified. Migration: https://github.com/ChromaDotNet/ChromaDB.Client#migrating-from-chromadbclient-1x",
